---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Resource Builder | Skill Foundry" description="Private publishing workspace for preparing Skill Foundry resources." robots="noindex, nofollow, noarchive">
  <section class="builder-page"><div class="builder-shell">
    <div class="builder-heading"><p class="eyebrow">RESOURCE BUILDER</p><h1>Create a resource without writing code.</h1><p>Prepare a resource in the same order visitors will read it. Save a browser draft, preview the content, and download a publish-ready resource file.</p></div>
    <div class="notice"><strong>Image upload</strong><span>Images can be selected directly here. Thumbnails use a 16:9 crop, while input and output images can use the display ratio you choose. The builder uploads selected images to the website automatically when GitHub publishing credentials are configured.</span></div>
    <form id="resource-form" class="builder-grid">
      <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>01</span><h2>Core details</h2></div><div class="field-grid">
        <label>Title<input name="title" required placeholder="Premium AI Product Photography Prompt" /></label>
        <label>Slug<div class="input-action"><input name="slug" placeholder="premium-ai-product-photography-prompt" /><button class="mini-button" id="make-slug" type="button">Generate</button></div><span class="field-note">The URL ending for this resource. Example: <code>/resources/my-prompt/</code>.</span></label>
        <label>Category<select name="category" required><option value="" selected disabled>Select a category</option><option>Image Generation</option><option>Video Generation</option><option>Product Photography</option><option>AI Tools</option><option>AI Workflows</option><option>Automation</option><option>Prompts</option><option>Tutorials</option><option>Other</option></select></label>
        <label class="full">Short description<textarea name="description" required rows="3" placeholder="A concise description used on resource cards and metadata."></textarea></label>
        <label>Date<input name="date" type="date" required /></label>
        <label>Image alt text<input name="imageAlt" placeholder="Describe the main result image" /></label>
      </div></section>

      <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>02</span><h2>Hero & thumbnail</h2></div><p class="panel-help">The hero is the large image on the resource page. The thumbnail is used on cards and related resources. They can use the same image.</p><div class="field-grid">
        <div class="image-field"><label>Thumbnail image</label><div class="upload-row"><input name="thumbnail" class="path-input" placeholder="/images/my-resource.jpg or image URL" /><label class="file-button"><input type="file" accept="image/*" data-image-file="thumbnail" />Choose image</label></div><div class="image-preview" data-preview="thumbnail"></div></div>
        <div class="image-field"><label>Hero image</label><div class="upload-row"><input name="heroImage" class="path-input" placeholder="/images/my-resource.jpg or image URL" /><label class="file-button"><input type="file" accept="image/*" data-image-file="heroImage" />Choose image</label></div><div class="image-preview" data-preview="heroImage"></div></div>
      </div></section>

      <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>03</span><h2>Introduction</h2></div><label class="full">Introduction<textarea name="intro" rows="7" placeholder="Explain what the resource is, what it is for, and when to use it."></textarea></label></section>
      <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>04</span><h2>What this resource does</h2></div><label class="full">Explanation<textarea name="whatItDoes" rows="7" placeholder="Explain the practical result and important details visible in the output."></textarea></label></section>

      <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>05</span><h2>Tools used</h2></div><p class="panel-help">Add the actual tool or model used for this resource. Add another only when the resource genuinely uses or recommends one.</p><div id="tools-list" class="repeat-list"></div><button class="add-button" data-add="tool" type="button" aria-label="Add another tool" title="Add another tool">+</button></section>

      <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>06</span><h2>Results</h2></div><p class="panel-help">Add one or more starting/input images and one or more output/result images. Selected files are previewed in this browser.</p>
        <div class="image-group"><div class="subheading"><h3>Input / starting images</h3></div><div id="inputs-list" class="repeat-list"></div><button class="add-button" data-add="input" type="button" aria-label="Add input image" title="Add input image">+</button></div>
        <div class="image-group"><div class="subheading"><h3>Output / result images</h3></div><div id="results-list" class="repeat-list"></div><button class="add-button" data-add="result" type="button" aria-label="Add output image" title="Add output image">+</button></div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>07</span><h2>Prompt</h2></div><label class="full">Complete prompt<textarea name="prompt" required rows="16" placeholder="Paste the complete prompt exactly as users should copy it."></textarea></label></section>
      <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>08</span><h2>Tutorial</h2></div><div class="field-grid"><label>Tutorial embed URL<input name="videoEmbedUrl" type="url" placeholder="https://www.youtube.com/embed/..." /></label><label>Original tutorial URL<input name="originalVideoUrl" type="url" placeholder="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=..." /></label></div><p class="panel-help bottom-help">Leave both fields empty when the resource has no tutorial.</p></section>

      <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>09</span><h2>Step by step</h2></div><p class="panel-help">Add the actual actions a visitor should follow.</p><div id="steps-list" class="repeat-list"></div><button class="add-button" data-add="step" type="button" aria-label="Add step" title="Add step">+</button></section>
      <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>10</span><h2>Tips for better results</h2></div><p class="panel-help">Add useful customization or troubleshooting tips.</p><div id="tips-list" class="repeat-list"></div><button class="add-button" data-add="tip" type="button" aria-label="Add tip" title="Add tip">+</button></section>
      <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>11</span><h2>Tags</h2></div><p class="panel-help">Add focused search terms.</p><div id="tags-list" class="repeat-list"></div><button class="add-button" data-add="tag" type="button" aria-label="Add tag" title="Add tag">+</button></section>
      <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>12</span><h2>Related resources</h2></div><p class="panel-help">Add resource slugs that should appear in the Related resources section.</p><div id="related-list" class="repeat-list"></div><button class="add-button" data-add="related" type="button" aria-label="Add related resource" title="Add related resource">+</button></section>

      <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>13</span><h2>SEO & publishing</h2></div><p class="panel-help">The visible Title is for visitors. SEO title is an optional search/browser title and does not replace the visible title.</p><div class="field-grid"><label class="full">SEO title<input name="seoTitle" placeholder="Unique search title for this resource" /></label><label class="full">SEO description<textarea name="seoDescription" rows="3" placeholder="Unique search description for this resource."></textarea></label><label class="check-inline"><input name="featured" type="checkbox" /> Feature this resource on the homepage</label></div><div class="actions"><button class="button button-secondary" id="save-draft" type="button">Save draft</button><button class="button button-secondary" id="clear-draft" type="button">Clear draft</button><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Download resource file</button></div><p class="status" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></section>
    </form>
    <section class="preview panel" aria-live="polite"><div class="panel-heading"><span>14</span><h2>Live preview</h2></div><div id="preview-content" class="preview-content"><p>Start filling the form to preview your resource.</p></div></section>
  </div></section>
  <style is:global>
    .builder-page{padding:58px 0 90px}.builder-shell{width:min(1080px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:0 auto}.builder-heading{max-width:800px;margin-bottom:28px}.builder-heading h1{margin-top:0;font-size:clamp(36px,6vw,62px)}.builder-heading p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:760px;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px}.notice{display:grid;gap:5px;margin-bottom:20px;padding:15px 17px;border:1px solid rgba(61,214,208,.2);border-radius:14px;background:rgba(61,214,208,.055);color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.notice strong{color:var(--text)}.builder-grid{display:grid;gap:18px}.panel{padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.025)}.panel-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;margin-bottom:20px}.panel-heading span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:30px;height:30px;flex:0 0 auto;border:1px solid rgba(61,214,208,.3);border-radius:9px;color:var(--accent);font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.panel-heading h2{margin:0;font-size:20px}.panel-help{margin:-7px 0 18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}.bottom-help{margin:15px 0 0}.field-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}.builder-page label{display:grid;gap:7px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:700}.builder-page label.full{grid-column:1/-1}.field-note{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5}.builder-page .check-inline{display:flex!important;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:46px}.builder-page .check-inline input{width:17px;height:17px;min-height:0;accent-color:var(--accent)}.builder-page input,.builder-page textarea,.builder-page select{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;background:rgba(7,17,31,.75);color:var(--text);font:inherit;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;outline:none}.builder-page input,.builder-page select{min-height:46px;padding:10px 12px}.builder-page textarea{padding:11px 12px;resize:none}.builder-page select{appearance:auto}.builder-page input:focus,.builder-page textarea:focus,.builder-page select:focus{border-color:rgba(61,214,208,.55);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(61,214,208,.07)}.input-action{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:7px}.mini-button,.add-button{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.035);color:var(--muted);font:inherit;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.mini-button{padding:0 12px}.mini-button:hover,.add-button:hover{border-color:rgba(61,214,208,.45);color:var(--accent);background:rgba(61,214,208,.055)}.repeat-list{display:grid;gap:10px}.repeat-add-button{display:grid!important;place-items:center;width:36px!important;height:36px!important;min-width:36px!important;min-height:36px!important;padding:0!important;margin-top:10px;border-radius:50%!important;font-size:20px!important;line-height:1!important}.repeat-item{position:relative;display:grid;gap:9px;padding:12px;padding-right:56px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:rgba(7,17,31,.45)}.repeat-item.tool{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.repeat-item.step{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.7fr) minmax(0,1.3fr)}.repeat-item label{font-size:11px}.repeat-item input,.repeat-item textarea{min-height:42px;font-size:13px}.remove-button{position:absolute;top:10px;right:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;width:32px!important;height:32px!important;min-width:32px!important;min-height:32px!important;padding:0!important;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.035);color:var(--muted);font:inherit;font-size:18px;font-weight:500;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;appearance:none;-webkit-appearance:none}.remove-button:hover,.remove-button:focus-visible{border-color:rgba(255,100,100,.5);color:#ff9b9b;background:rgba(255,100,100,.07);outline:none}.subsection,.image-group{margin-top:22px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.image-group:first-child{margin-top:0;padding-top:0;border-top:0}.subheading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:11px}.subheading h3{margin:0;color:var(--text);font-size:14px}.upload-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:8px;align-items:stretch}.file-button{display:flex!important;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:96px;min-height:46px;padding:0 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:rgba(16,34,56,.55);color:var(--text);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.file-button:hover{border-color:rgba(61,214,208,.45);color:var(--accent);background:rgba(61,214,208,.07)}.file-button input{display:none!important}.image-preview{display:none;margin-top:9px}.image-preview.has-image{display:block}.image-preview img{display:block;width:min(100%,420px);max-height:260px;object-fit:cover;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px}.image-preview span{display:block;margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.media-item .file-button{font-size:0}.media-item .file-button::after{content:'Select';font-size:12px}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:22px}.status{min-height:20px;margin:10px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.preview{margin-top:18px}.preview-content{display:grid;gap:15px}.preview-content h3{margin:0;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,42px);line-height:1.1}.preview-content h4{margin:8px 0 -7px;font-size:15px}.preview-meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.preview-copy{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;white-space:pre-wrap}.preview-image{width:min(100%,720px);max-height:420px;object-fit:cover;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px}.preview-list{display:grid;gap:8px;margin:0;padding-left:20px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.preview-prompt{padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;background:rgba(7,17,31,.7);color:var(--muted);white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.preview-tools{display:grid;gap:9px}.preview-tool{padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px}.preview-tool strong{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;color:var(--text)}.preview-tool span{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.image-field{min-width:0}
    @media(max-width:700px){.builder-shell{width:min(calc(100% - 28px),1080px)}.builder-page{padding-top:38px}.field-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.builder-page label.full{grid-column:auto}.panel{padding:17px;border-radius:15px}.actions .button{width:100%}.repeat-item.tool,.repeat-item.step{grid-template-columns:1fr}.upload-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto}.file-button{min-width:92px;min-height:44px;padding-inline:10px}.input-action{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mini-button{min-height:42px}.subheading{align-items:center}.repeat-add-button{width:36px!important;height:36px!important;min-width:36px!important}.repeat-item{padding-right:52px}.remove-button{width:32px!important;min-width:32px!important;min-height:32px!important}}
  </style>
  <script is:inline src="/admin/resource-builder.js?v=20260909-4"></script>
</BaseLayout>
